## Signature

- Provided by: **Qwen 3.8 Max (qwen/qwen-3.8-max)** — 2026-11-01
- Method: public internet research (**Z.ai GLM-4.5 docs** — family table (GLM-4.5 355B/32B, Air 106B/12B), 128K ctx, hybrid thinking modes, Claude-Code/Roo-Code; **GLM-4.5-Flash shown only as "Free / Strong Performance / Excellent for Reasoning, Coding & Agents" with no benchmark row**; **`artificialanalysis.ai/models/glm-4-5-flash` → 404** (no independent index/speed/cost; flagship GLM-4.5 has a page); **`benchlm.ai/models/glm-4-5-flash` → 404** (no aggregated cell); **Puter Developer `z-ai/glm-4.5-flash`** — "free tier in Z.ai's GLM-4.5 family … shares the hybrid reasoning architecture," 128K/96K-out, text-only, tool use yes, released Jul 28 2025, **specs only / no capability score**; **glm-ai.chat GLM-4.5 family page** — "Flash is the free tier," family averages belong to GLM-4.5 (63.2) / Air (59.8), "GLM-4.7-Flash is the newer free model"; **`model-queue.md`** — confirms only `glm-4.5-flash` is a dataset entry (no separately-scored GLM-4.5/Air base). **Curated `meta`** — free lightweight, 128K, dual thinking modes, tool-calling, but "lower headroom … multi-file SWE-bench" with no number.)
- Future sources: this becomes scoreable **only if** Z.ai publishes a **GLM-4.5-Flash-branded benchmark table** (as it did for GLM-4.7-Flash), or an independent tracker (**Artificial Analysis / benchlm / Vals / a hands-on leader**) measures an artifact **under the `glm-4.5-flash` id**. **Guards applied:** (1) do **NOT** reattribute the **GLM-4.5 flagship (63.2 avg / SWE 77.8-era figures)** or **GLM-4.5-Air (59.8 avg)** numbers onto this free, lighter Flash — that overstates a deliberately-lower tier; (2) do **NOT** import **GLM-4.7-Flash**'s scored numbers (SWE 59.2 / τ² 79.5 / AIME 91.6 / GPQA 75.2) or **GLM-4.6V-Flash** (VLM) — separate models; (3) reject the search-snippet **"87.0 AIME / 67.9 SWE"** near the Flash — it belongs to a different model's card, not this id; (4) **text-only** — no vision credit; **`glm-4.5-flash` ≠ `glm-4.5` ≠ `glm-4.5-air`**. **No dimension scores are assigned.**
